<title>ROMANIA: TENNIS-ROMANIA LEAD NETHERLANDS 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ROMANIA LEAD NETHERLANDS 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania took a 1-0 lead over the</p>
<p>Netherlands in their Davis Cup world group first round tie after</p>
<p>winning the opening singles on Friday.</p>
<p>Result;</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea beat Paul Haarhuis 4-6 6-1 6-3 6-3.</p>
</text>
